  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">本模組允許以下實體：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">來自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guard-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">守衛村民</a>的守衛；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">來自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">村民招募</a>的弩手。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">使用以下槍械模組：&nbsp;</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CGM</a>；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod-unofficial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CGMu</a>（1.20.1+）；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classic-guns-tac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">永恆經典槍械</a>（1.18.2）。</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">注意</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">您<span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong>絕對可以</strong></span>將此模組加入您的模組包。</span></p>",
